The 8 vinyl animation frames in
app/src/main/java/dev/glyphrotator/app/glyph/VinylBeatAnimation.kt
are taken verbatim from VinylTheme.kt in Glyph Beat, and the shaped-to-grid
conversion follows the same approach used there for the Nothing Phone (3).
These frames are used only on the Nothing Phone (3). On other matrix sizes the
same file generates a different vinyl with this project's own code.

